# ============================================================
# FGFR3 Full Signaling Cascade Model — Revised & Extended
#
# Pathways:
#   1. Receptor Activation (R → LR → Dimer → Cbl endocytosis)
#   2. MAPK/ERK Cascade (FRS2 → GRB2 → SOS1 → RAS → RAF → MEK → ERK)
#      + SHP2 positive feedback amplification
#   3. PLCγ/IP3/Ca²⁺ Pathway (Li-Rinzel IP3R — corrected)
#   4. PI3K/AKT Pathway (GAB1 → PI3K → PIP3 → AKT)
#      + Competitive GRB2 pool (SOS1 vs GAB1)
#   5. Sprouty Negative Feedback
#   6. JAK-STAT Module (STAT1, STAT3, STAT5 — newly added)
#      + SOCS negative feedback
#
# Corrections (per review document):
#   - GRB2-SOS1-RAS mechanism: pFRS2 → GRB2 → SOS1 → RAS
#   - Competitive GRB2 pool: SOS1 (MAPK) vs GAB1 (PI3K)
#   - SHP2 amplification: pFRS2 → SHP2p → extra GRB2 capacity
#   - Li-Rinzel IP3R: dh/dt = a2*(IP3+d1)*(h_inf - h)  [erroneous 'h*Ca_i' removed]
#   - ERK dual phosphorylation: two independent MM reactions
#   - Realistic concentrations: nM-to-low-µM range
#   - Cbl-mediated endocytosis: dynamic k_intern
#   - JAK-STAT module: STAT1/3/5 phosphorylation, nuclear translocation, SOCS
# ============================================================

